# The rendered speech is committed, not ignored. It is 25MB across 1584 files,
# which is a lot for a repo — but the static build has no server to synthesise on
# demand, and rebuilding it depends on an unofficial Edge endpoint that can vanish
# without notice. Losing it would mean an app that cannot speak.
# data/audio_cache/
